### Completed
- Subdomain recon saved: `result/inventory/subdomains.md`, `result/inventory/subdomains-hackertarget.txt` (live hosts: duel.com, www, pvp, uat-us-pvp, sp, sports-proxy, clips, roulette, avatars, jobs, snowplow-collector, track.mail, staging/uat/dev behind CF Access).
- Created inventory files: `result/inventory/routes.md`, `result/inventory/endpoints.md`, `result/inventory/javascript.md`, `result/client-side/duel.com/root/javascript/manifest.md`; appended continuation notes to `result/logs/session.md`.
- Downloaded JS for static analysis: `/tmp/duel_index.js` (sha256 `e6dcdc92b6d9efe448e626712878146ab201f6df718b32ff1597baea73e9bc83`), 140 app chunks in `/tmp/chunks/` (chunk list in `/tmp/chunks_app.txt`).
- Verified auth/session with accounts A and B; both can read `GET /api/v2/user` (200).
- Tested `PATCH /api/v2/user` mass assignment: all 405 — route supports only `GET, HEAD, DELETE`; no field change.
- Tested referral code collision: B `POST /api/v2/referrals/set-personal-code {code:"dtestqa7412"}` -> 400 `"The chosen referral code is already in use by someone else."`; B code unchanged/restored.
- Tested public profile `GET /api/v2/user/profile/{username}/public` for A and B -> 200, only public stats (ids, avatar, bet/profit stats); `GET /api/v2/user/{username}/profile-link` -> 404; no sensitive leak found.
- Enumerated API endpoints from JS chunks; notable: `/api/v2/referrals`, `/api/v2/referrals/referred-users`, `/api/v2/referrals/referred-users/payouts`, `/api/v2/user/payouts`, `/api/v2/store/credit`, `/api/v2/trade/gift-codes`, `/api/v2/trade/swapped/url`, `/api/v2/trade/nicheclear`, `/api/v2/payments/paymentiq`, `/api/v2/transparency/bets`, `/api/v2/transparency/players`, `/api/v2/transparency/{e}/stats`, game endpoints (`/api/v2/dice` etc.), `/api/v2/leaderboard`, `/api/v2/captcha/agent|widget`.
- Static sink review: `SlotPage-DkkFLaP6.js` postMessage listener validates `t.source` ancestry against iframe but not origin; `#merch-transfer` hash handler reads `merch-transfer` amount + `email` and prefills `CreditTransferModal` (redirectTo fixed `https://duel.shop/checkout`); `WalletModal` parses payment response URL into form/`window.location.href` (provider-controlled); no obvious DOM XSS found in main bundle.

### Active
- Continuing server-side endpoint testing on authenticated accounts A/B; next focus: authorization/IDOR/BOLA on account, referral, payout, transparency, and game endpoints; mass assignment on create/edit endpoints; business-logic on credit transfer/gift codes.
- Static review of remaining chunks for client-side sinks (`innerHTML`, `location.href`, `postMessage`) in route-specific flows (`useSPInstance`, `cross-road`, `sdk-kzKaA8Ug`, `recorder`, `_id_`).

