- `result/confirmed-vuln.txt`, `result/findings/`: output locations (no findings yet).
- `/tmp/duel_index.js`, `/tmp/chunks/`, `/tmp/chunks_app.txt`: main SPA JS for offline analysis (auth chunk at `/tmp/chunks/auth-ChFQGnu9.js`).
- `/tmp/pvp_index.html`, `/tmp/pvp_index.js`, `/tmp/pvp_chunks/`: PvP SPA for arena socket analysis.
